# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Open-source repository scope
#
# This repository publishes only the dataset (`DataSet/`) and the experiment
# runners (`experimental_code/`). Raw experimental outputs and rendered
# figures from the paper are NOT redistributed via GitHub — they are kept
# locally and (optionally) in private archives.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local-only artifacts that must never be committed
Experimental data/
Picture/
Picture Code/

# Local env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
